{"subject": "KK Compass 2026-10-20｜幣 觀望（BTC -3）｜美股 買META", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#182024;max-width:640px;line-height:1.6\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5d686c\">KK Compass 2・2026-10-20 07:51（台北）</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #182024;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:4px\">今天要做的事</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;margin:3px 0\">₿ 加密貨幣：不做（BTC -3 偏空，沒有回測支持的機會）</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;margin:3px 0\">🇺🇸 今晚 10-20 21:30 開盤買：META（停損 643.96，倉位本金 2.9%）</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;margin:3px 0\">🇺🇸 續抱不用動：AAPL、AMD、INTC、MRVL、NVDA、PANW、PLTR</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#5d686c;margin-top:4px\">詳細設定（停損單、怎麼賣、買多少）在下面各區。</div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:18px 0 4px;padding:5px 10px;background:#e6e8e3;color:#182024;border-radius:4px\">大盤雷達</h2><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px\"><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">Nasdaq 100 期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">29,765.75</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#18865a;text-align:right\">+1.27%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">報價 10-20 07:42</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">S&amp;P 500 期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">7,744.00</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#18865a;text-align:right\">+0.52%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">報價 10-20 07:42</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">道瓊期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo